  "executable_requirements": [
    "AMEND-REC-27-A executes through real center HTTP/SQLite and a real agent runtime same-process retry; not a JSON parse only.",
    "AMEND-REC-27-B executes through the process-level crash harness and real agent persistence; the new generation/boot is observed in persisted state and at the center, the report_id is unchanged, duplicate advances high-water, and only one stored report copy exists.",
    "AMEND-REC-27-C executes a real HTTP request from the retired generation and asserts no center state change.",
    "AMEND-REC-27-D executes the real status/read-only CLI against a persisted state and compares state/tree/mtime or equivalent bytes; no mutation or network request is allowed.",
    "AMEND-REC-27-E executes a real HTTP request with the same generation and different boot id.",
    "AMEND-REC-27-F executes real bounded forward-gap requests after consecutive offline restarts and checks the gap audit.",
    "The fixture's setup/expected fields are the assertion source; a changed fixture value changes the test outcome.",
    "Revision-5 REC-17/18/04/30, rotation, generation exhaustion and repeated unclean-restart tests remain mandatory."
  ],
